       "description": "TotalPM25 (ug/m3) vs receptor cell-centroid easting. The ISRM grid is an unstructured variable-resolution polygon mesh with a single flat index, so field_snapshot (structured lat-lon) does not apply and a polygon choropleth is out of format scope; scatter has no per-point colour channel, so the value is on the y-axis.",
       "x": {
